{
  "title": "平行四边形面积公式是怎么来的？",
  "formula": "S = a × h",
  "steps": [
    {
      "title": "认识平行四边形",
      "narration": "这是一个平行四边形，它的底是 a，高是 h。我们想知道它的面积，但还不会直接算。能不能把它变成长方形呢？",
      "scene": {
        "shapes": [
          {
            "id": "para",
            "type": "parallelogram",
            "points": [{"x":120,"y":200},{"x":240,"y":200},{"x":270,"y":120},{"x":150,"y":120}],
            "fill": "#eef2ff",
            "stroke": "#6366f1",
            "strokeWidth": 2
          },
          {
            "id": "base-label",
            "type": "text",
            "x": 180,
            "y": 220,
            "text": "底 a",
            "fontSize": 15,
            "textFill": "#4f46e5",
            "data": { "anchor": "middle" }
          },
          {
            "id": "height-label",
            "type": "text",
            "x": 138,
            "y": 160,
            "text": "高 h",
            "fontSize": 14,
            "textFill": "#4f46e5",
            "data": { "anchor": "end" }
          }
        ],
        "labels": [
          { "text": "怎么算平行四边形的面积？", "x": 200, "y": 255, "fontSize": 14, "fill": "#6b7280" }
        ],
        "highlight": ["para"]
      },
      "hint": "能不能把平行四边形变成长方形？"
    },
    {
      "title": "沿高画一条线",
      "narration": "从左上角的顶点向底边画一条垂直的线——这就是高。这条高把平行四边形分成了两部分：左边一个三角形，右边一个梯形。",
      "scene": {
        "shapes": [
          {
            "id": "para2",
            "type": "parallelogram",
            "points": [{"x":120,"y":200},{"x":240,"y":200},{"x":270,"y":120},{"x":150,"y":120}],
            "fill": "#eef2ff",
            "stroke": "#6366f1",
            "strokeWidth": 2
          },
          {
            "id": "height-line",
            "type": "line",
            "x": 150,
            "y": 120,
            "width": 0,
            "height": 80,
            "stroke": "#ef4444",
            "strokeWidth": 2
          },
          {
            "id": "h-label2",
            "type": "text",
            "x": 140,
            "y": 160,
            "text": "h",
            "fontSize": 14,
            "textFill": "#ef4444",
            "data": { "anchor": "end" }
          },
          {
            "id": "base-label2",
            "type": "text",
            "x": 180,
            "y": 220,
            "text": "a",
            "fontSize": 15,
            "textFill": "#4f46e5",
            "data": { "anchor": "middle" }
          }
        ],
        "labels": [
          { "text": "沿高剪开", "x": 200, "y": 255, "fontSize": 14, "fill": "#ef4444" }
        ],
        "highlight": ["height-line"]
      },
      "hint": "高把平行四边形分成三角形和梯形"
    },
    {
      "title": "剪开成两部分",
      "narration": "沿着高剪开后，左边是一个直角三角形，右边是一个直角梯形。看，左边这个三角形和右边缺掉的部分形状一样！",
      "scene": {
        "shapes": [
          {
            "id": "triangle-left",
            "type": "triangle",
            "points": [{"x":120,"y":200},{"x":150,"y":120},{"x":150,"y":200}],
            "fill": "#fef3c7",
            "stroke": "#f59e0b",
            "strokeWidth": 2
          },
          {
            "id": "trapezoid-right",
            "type": "trapezoid",
            "points": [{"x":150,"y":200},{"x":240,"y":200},{"x":270,"y":120},{"x":150,"y":120}],
            "fill": "#dbeafe",
            "stroke": "#3b82f6",
            "strokeWidth": 2
          },
          {
            "id": "tri-label",
            "type": "text",
            "x": 138,
            "y": 180,
            "text": "三角形",
            "fontSize": 11,
            "textFill": "#92400e",
            "data": { "anchor": "middle" }
          },
          {
            "id": "trap-label",
            "type": "text",
            "x": 205,
            "y": 160,
            "text": "梯形",
            "fontSize": 11,
            "textFill": "#1e3a8a",
            "data": { "anchor": "middle" }
          }
        ],
        "labels": [
          { "text": "左边三角形和右边缺口形状相同", "x": 200, "y": 255, "fontSize": 13, "fill": "#6b7280" }
        ],
        "highlight": ["triangle-left"]
      },
      "hint": "左边的三角形可以填到右边的缺口"
    },
    {
      "title": "把三角形移到右边",
      "narration": "把左边的三角形平移到右边，刚好填满右边的缺口！拼出来的图形有四个直角——是一个长方形！",
      "scene": {
        "shapes": [
          {
            "id": "rect-result",
            "type": "rect",
            "x": 150,
            "y": 120,
            "width": 120,
            "height": 80,
            "fill": "#d1fae5",
            "stroke": "#10b981",
            "strokeWidth": 2
          },
          {
            "id": "moved-tri",
            "type": "triangle",
            "points": [{"x":270,"y":120},{"x":240,"y":200},{"x":270,"y":200}],
            "fill": "#fef3c7",
            "stroke": "#f59e0b",
            "strokeWidth": 2,
            "opacity": 0.6
          },
          {
            "id": "arrow-move",
            "type": "arrow",
            "x": 140,
            "y": 160,
            "width": 50,
            "height": 0,
            "stroke": "#ef4444",
            "strokeWidth": 2
          },
          {
            "id": "move-text",
            "type": "text",
            "x": 165,
            "y": 145,
            "text": "平移",
            "fontSize": 12,
            "textFill": "#ef4444",
            "data": { "anchor": "middle" }
          }
        ],
        "labels": [
          { "text": "三角形移到右边 → 拼成长方形！", "x": 200, "y": 255, "fontSize": 14, "fill": "#059669" }
        ],
        "highlight": ["rect-result"]
      },
      "hint": "拼出来的长方形：长 = 底a，宽 = 高h"
    },
    {
      "title": "得出公式",
      "narration": "拼成的长方形，长就是平行四边形的底 a，宽就是平行四边形的高 h。因为面积没变，所以平行四边形面积 = 底 × 高 = a × h！",
      "scene": {
        "shapes": [
          {
            "id": "final-rect",
            "type": "rect",
            "x": 150,
            "y": 120,
            "width": 120,
            "height": 80,
            "fill": "#eef2ff",
            "stroke": "#6366f1",
            "strokeWidth": 2
          },
          {
            "id": "len-line",
            "type": "line",
            "x": 150,
            "y": 210,
            "width": 120,
            "height": 0,
            "stroke": "#a5b4fc",
            "strokeWidth": 1.5
          },
          {
            "id": "len-text",
            "type": "text",
            "x": 210,
            "y": 223,
            "text": "长 = a（底）",
            "fontSize": 13,
            "textFill": "#4f46e5",
            "data": { "anchor": "middle" }
          },
          {
            "id": "wid-line",
            "type": "line",
            "x": 138,
            "y": 120,
            "width": 0,
            "height": 80,
            "stroke": "#a5b4fc",
            "strokeWidth": 1.5
          },
          {
            "id": "wid-text",
            "type": "text",
            "x": 125,
            "y": 160,
            "text": "宽=h",
            "fontSize": 13,
            "textFill": "#4f46e5",
            "data": { "anchor": "middle" }
          }
        ],
        "labels": [
          { "text": "平行四边形面积 = 长方形面积", "x": 200, "y": 255, "fontSize": 14, "fill": "#374151" }
        ],
        "formula": "S = a × h"
      },
      "hint": "底 × 高 = 长 × 宽 = 面积"
    }
  ]
}
